<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Given</p>

<p>
<md>|x_n-x^*|
\leq
3^{-n},</md>
</p>

<p>find a sufficient <m>n</m> to guarantee error below <m>10^{-5}</m>.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

